  "ingredients": [
    "1 eggplant, halved lengthwise",
    "0.5 cup olive oil, divided",
    "salt and pepper to taste",
    "1/2 teaspoon ground black pepper",
    "1 pound sweet Italian sausage, casings removed",
    "1 cup chopped onion",
    "1 cup sliced fresh mushrooms",
    "2 cloves garlic, chopped",
    "2 tablespoons chopped fresh parsley",
    "1 cup tomato-basil pasta sauce",
    "2 cups Italian seasoned bread crumbs",
    "0.5 cup grated Parmesan cheese, divided"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather ingredients. Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Line a rimmed baking sheet with foil.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/RJ156MgXWu6Zot_VmFbfLHXMZsE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/38331-stuffed-eggplant-mfs-step1-3x4-1965-dd52f50e8c404aa0bfa8bf0922af4ff9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/38331/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cut around the edge of the flesh in each eggplant half using a sharp paring knife, leaving a 1/2-inch border. Scoop out flesh using a spoon, leaving 1/2-inch-thick shell; reserve flesh and chop into bite-size pieces.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/SJQ5mRG1eBcEUF-Ihxk1dZd7iaY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/38331-stuffed-eggplant-mfs-step2-3x4-1971-50f55ffa990e4d00a761bf301d806dd9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/38331/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Brush shells with 2 tablespoons olive oil and season with salt and pepper; set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/TCoRcJdtlYtx3kTazDK6W_Rhfw8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/38331-stuffed-eggplant-mfs-step3-3x4-1990-d52bd4fbdf9d4cdfa8d46aa400ec86cf.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/38331/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat remaining 1 tablespoon olive oil in a large, deep skillet over medium high heat. Add sausage, onion, mushrooms, and garlic; cook and stir until sausage is evenly brown. Stir in reserved chopped eggplant and basil. Add pasta sauce; cook and stir for 5 minutes. Mix in 1/2 cup of panko and 1/4 cup Parmesan cheese.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Ehf3aZuZHx9bPSo4yHHLGq5VSDU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/38331-stuffed-eggplant-mfs-step7-3x4-1992-c2541c2762bd4af6ab622e14947ceec4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/38331/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stuff mixture into eggplant shells. Combine remaining panko and cheese in a small bowl; sprinkle over stuffing.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/fBhD7Epaf6A15LEtuk_EVvn-_KU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/38331-stuffed-eggplant-mfs-step8-3x4-1998-eb05e845c7b942d7a56ff3abb63091fa.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/38331/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until eggplant is tender, 45 to 50 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/8RgUktgaFdv84YB5y-6C81jMjqA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/38331-stuffed-eggplant-mfs-step9-3x4-2000-23336fa8362345acb4ebc9224e579f4f.jpg"
      ],
